    narr:narration """Quinton Fairweather has established a new [Meridian deployment gate](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1), mandating that all releases carry a signed manifest before deployment. This requirement, which [applies to both staging and production](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4), is framed as a direct response to [past security lapses](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2) involving unsigned artifacts. Fairweather has [formally assumed ownership](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5) of this gate, positioning the mandate as a necessary conservation measure to ensure deployment competence. The communication style is consistent and authoritative, utilizing [standardized editorial summaries](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) to codify the decision as a settled organizational fact.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The justification for the gate rests on specific past failures, contrasting with the abstract, rule-based framing of the requirement itself." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "conviction" ; narr:reading "Moves from declarative mandate to matter-of-fact ownership." ; narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "register" ; narr:reading "Shifts between formal instruction and plain-spoken causal explanation." ; narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "style" ; narr:reading "Relies on stock-phrase structures to codify authority." ; narr:text "**Gate**: signed release manifest required for Meridian deploys" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
